WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.500
<v Sam Rivera>Thanks for taking the call, Priti. I wanted to hear how the first month with our analytics add-on went.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Priti Nair>Honestly it's been good. The dashboards load much faster than our old tool, and the team uses them every day.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Sam Rivera>That's great to hear. Is there anything that's slowing your team down?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Priti Nair>Exports. We need to send a weekly report to finance, and right now someone copies numbers into a spreadsheet by hand.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:47.000
<v Sam Rivera>Scheduled exports are in beta right now. Would you like early access? I can turn it on for your workspace today.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.000
<v Priti Nair>Yes please. And can the export go straight to a shared email address?

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:02.000
<v Sam Rivera>It can. I'll enable the beta today and send you a setup guide by tomorrow morning.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:10.000
<v Priti Nair>Perfect. One more question, what does pricing look like if we add 20 more seats next quarter?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:20.000
<v Sam Rivera>You'd keep your current rate of $30 per seat. I'll send over a quote so you have it for budgeting.
